# Vendored third-party files are verified against the published SRI hashes (src/ui/leaflet_map.py), so their bytes must never be
# converted. Without this, core.autocrlf (the Windows default) rewrites leaflet.js to CRLF on checkout and the map refuses to load,
# and the CSS (CRLF upstream) had been stored with LF.
src/ui/vendor/leaflet/* -text
